  dialogues:
  - speaker: 0
    message: " [laughs softly] Welcome, traveler! I\u2019m Athena, goddess of wisdom.
      What a beautiful day! Tell me, have you come to see my Athens?"
    emotion: 2
  - speaker: 1
    message: " [laughs proudly] [speak fast] [moderate pitch] Athena, this mortal
      uses smart devices\u2014[snorts] clearly from another timeline, knowing nothing
      of your city! [boasts] [high pitch]  I am Poseidon, ruler of the seas! [commands] 
      Mortal, press the seal bearing Zeus\u2019s face, and let your voice reach me.
      [graciously] Now, State your name, mortal\u2014and tell me what wisdom you
      seek."
    emotion: 3
